OL,3,GNEWSACouncil proposes 26% cut to       
OL,4,Alibrary budget                         
OL,6,FA local authority has proposed cutting 
OL,7,Fits annual budget for libraries and    
OL,8,Fleisure centres by at least 20%.       
OL,10,FDurham County Council has suggested    
OL,11,Freducing its library and leisure centre
OL,12,Fbudget by 26% and 20% respectively in  
OL,13,Fthe 2028-29 financial year.            
OL,15,FIt said the plans were still at their  
OL,16,Fearliest stages and could not say      
OL,17,Fwhether the cuts would mean sites being
OL,18,Fshut down or opening hours being scaled
OL,19,Fback.                                  
