OL,3,GNEWSACouncil proposes 26% cut to       
OL,4,Alibrary budget                         
OL,6,FThe authority's culture strategic      
OL,7,Fmanager Sarah Glynn said no decisions  
OL,8,Fabout the plans had yet been made. "Any
OL,9,Fproposals for significant change would 
OL,10,Fbe subject to the appropriate          
OL,11,Fengagement, consultation and           
OL,12,Fdecision-making process," she said.    
